---
// src/components/StoreNutrientMatrix.astro
---

<!-- 🥗 Block 6: The Nutrient Equivalence Matrix (Mobile-First Architecture) -->
<section id="nutrient-matrix" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#111827] border-t border-gray-200/80 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  {/* Atmospheric Soft Emerald Glow */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] md:w-[900px] h-[600px] md:h-[900px] bg-emerald-500/[0.04] rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
    
    {/* 1. Editorial Header */}
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/70 border border-emerald-300/50 mb-3.5 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-700 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#166534] font-sans">
          The Nutritional Equivalence
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-normal text-[#111827] tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3">
        The Anatomy of <span class="italic text-[#166534]">1 Daily Dose.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 font-normal max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-sans">
        How a single 3g serving (1 scoop or 2 veg capsules) delivers the concentrated micronutrient density of five whole foods.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* 2. Central Hero Dose Pill */}
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-[#022C22] via-[#064E3B] to-[#022C22] text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl border border-emerald-400/20 text-center mb-10 md:mb-12 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-emerald-400/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-emerald-300 block mb-1 font-sans">
        1 Serving (3g Powder / 2 Capsules)
      </span>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-white font-normal mb-2">
        Sujata Cold-Pressed Spirulina
      </h3>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-100/90 font-sans">
        <span class="bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">65% Complete Protein</span>
        <span class="bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">4x Bio-Iron</span>
        <span class="bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">95% Cellular Bio-Absorption</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 3. The 5 Equivalence Cards (Mobile 2-Col/1-Col Grid, Desktop 5-Col Grid) */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 sm:gap-5 mb-10">
      
      {/* 1. Vitamin A - 10 Carrots */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-amber-400/60 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🥕</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">
              Vitamin A
            </span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111827] font-serif mb-1 leading-snug">Equal to 10 Carrots</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Raw natural beta-carotene for macular vision clarity and collagen synthesis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 font-sans">
          ✓ Cell Radiance
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 2. Bio-Iron - 2 Bowls Spinach */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🥬</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">
              Bio-Iron
            </span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111827] font-serif mb-1 leading-snug">Equal to 2 Bowls Spinach</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Non-heme plant iron to boost hemoglobin without synthetic constipation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-700 font-sans">
          ✓ RBC Formation
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 3. Protein - 1 Whole Egg */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-amber-400/60 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🥚</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">
              Pure Protein
            </span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111827] font-serif mb-1 leading-snug">Equal to 1 Whole Egg</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            All 9 essential amino acids for daily muscle maintenance and tissue rejuvenation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 font-sans">
          ✓ All 9 Essential EAAs
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 4. Bio-Calcium - 1 Glass Milk */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-400/60 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🥛</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 border border-blue-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">
              Plant Calcium
            </span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111827] font-serif mb-1 leading-snug">Equal to 1 Glass Milk</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Alkaline plant-derived calcium for bone mineral density (100% lactose-free).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-700 font-sans">
          ✓ Lactose-Free
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 5. Phycocyanin - 3 Handfuls Blueberries */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-purple-400/60 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🫐</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-purple-50 text-purple-800 border border-purple-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">
              Antioxidant
            </span>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111827] font-serif mb-1 leading-snug">Equal to 3 Handfuls Berries</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Exclusive blue Phycocyanin to scavenge free radicals and reduce systemic inflammation.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100 text-[11px] font-bold text-purple-700 font-sans">
          ✓ Cellular Detox
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* 4. Bottom Household Economy Callout */}
    <div class="bg-emerald-50/80 border border-emerald-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#064E3B] font-medium font-sans">
        💡 <strong>The Smart Health Math:</strong> Buying these 5 organic whole foods daily costs <strong>₹180–₹220/day</strong>. One serving of Sujata Spirulina delivers equivalent active density at just <strong>₹20/day</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>
